		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>j&#039;ai fait tous ça j&#039;ai désactivé le pare-feu mais j&#039;ai encore l&#039;erreur could not connect to the server ;connection failed for[192.168.1.64:5432]<br />sur postgresql.conf j&#039;ai mis listen_addresses=&#039;192.168.1.64,localhost&#039;<br />sur pg_hba.conf j&#039;ai mis <br /># TYPE&#160; DATABASE&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; USER&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ADDRESS&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;METHOD</p><p># IPv4 local connections:<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;127.0.0.1/32&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; md5<br />host&#160; &#160; basee&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;192.168.0.0/0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; md5<br />tous cela je l&#039;ai fait sur la machine serveur</p>]]></content>
